{title: Aji Hamse Bachkar Kahan Jaiyega}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Aji hamse [A]bachkar kahan jaaiyega,
[E]Jahan jaaiyega [A]hame paaiyega
[E]Aji humse bachkar....
[B]Yeh kaisa [E]nasha hai, [A]yeh kaisa [E]asar hai
[B]Na kabu [E]me dil hai, [A]na bas [E]me najar hai
[B]Jara hosh aa [E]le chale jayiyega
[B]Theher jayiyega [E]Theher jayiyega
[E]Aji humse [A]bachkar kahan jayiyega,
[E]Jahan jayiyega [A]hame payiyega
[E]Aji hamse bachkar....
